# Rigid-body test: a grid of 8-atom rigid cubes
# Reduced version of the system used to validate fix rigid/small/kk.
# Run the non-Kokkos and Kokkos versions and compare the thermo output:
#   lmp -in in.rigid.cubes
#   lmp -k on -sf kk -in in.rigid.cubes
# (data.rigid.cubes is produced by gen_cubes.py)

